        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonathan Lynn, Ettore Scola, Antony Jay\n- Works: Yes Minister, Captain Fracassa's Journey\n- Roles: director, producer, writer, actor, screenwriter\n- Organizations: BBC Two\n\nFacts:\n- Ettore Scola was born on 10 May 1931 and died on 19 January 2016.\n- Jonathan Lynn was born on 3 April 1943.\n- Jonathan Lynn is an English stage and film director, producer, writer, and actor.\n- Ettore Scola was an Italian screenwriter and film director.\n- Yes Minister is a British political satire sitcom written by Antony Jay and Jonathan Lynn.\n- Yes Minister was first transmitted on BBC Two from 1980 to 1984 over three seven-episode series.\n- Captain Fracassa's Journey, titled Il viaggio di Capitan Fracassa in Italian, is a 1990 Italian comedy film directed by Ettore Scola.",
